      "id": "107c68e61bfac05481dadbeffc49aceba32",
      "name": "Salmon poke bowl low carb low sodium",
      "description": "Delicious, fresh and healthy. Salmon is a great source of protein with many vital nutrients. Perfect for this low carb and low sodium poke bowl. \n\nFor more recipes, join the community by clicking the source. ",
      "ingredients": [
        {
          "text": "120 g fresh salmon (skin and bones removed)"
        },
        {
          "text": "1/2 cucumber"
        },
        {
          "text": "1/2 punnet cherry tomatoes"
        },
        {
          "text": "1/2 red onion"
        },
        {
          "text": "Handful coriander"
        },
        {
          "text": "Black sesame seeds"
        },
        {
          "text": "1 tbs lime juice"
        },
        {
          "text": "1 tsp low salt Tamari"
        },
        {
          "text": "1/2 red chilli (optional)"
        }
      ],
      "instructions": {
        "steps": [
          {
            "text": "Set a frying pan on high heat and add the black sesame seeds. Toss and keep stirring until they are lightly toasted. You’ll be able to tell from the aroma. Set aside."
          },
          {
            "text": "Cut the red onions into thin slices. Half the cherry tomatoes. Cut the cucumber into thick slices, then quarter the slices.\nRoughly chop the coriander. If using, thinly slice the red chilli."
          },
          {
            "text": "Cut the fresh salmon into roughly one inch chunks."
          },
          {
            "text": "In a bowl, mix the lemon juice and low salt tamari sauce."
          },
          {
            "text": "Add the salmon and vegetables, and mix well."
          },
          {
            "text": "Sprinkle on the black sesame seeds."
          }
        ]
      },
